# The source is Chromium's monolithic depot_tools+gclient checkout.
# This is NOT a tarball — see the CI/CD build script for how to
# prepare the source tree before invoking makepkg.
#
# The PKGBUILD expects ${srcdir}/chromiumos-src/ to contain a fully
# synced ChromiumOS checkout with patches already applied.
#
# For a fresh pinned build, first run ci/bootstrap-chromium-src.sh. For a
# warm checkout, ci/build-current-chromiumos-ash-package.sh refreshes the
# current series and drives this PKGBUILD in an isolated work directory.
source=(
